New pure region/LakesideJourneyAtmosphere.ts: smootherstep weight from mid-bridge (15.5 m) to 1 m before
her stop (38.2 m of 39.2 m; on the 17 s timed walk 7.15 -> 14.97 s, max 1/255 colour step per 60 Hz frame).
Targets = LakesideBoardBackground.applyDir/applyFog from the same island base: main light direction
(slerp to sunForward), colour, illuminance x sunIlluminanceScale, ambient sky/ground, skyIllum = base x
ambientSkyIllumToSun, world camera clear colour -> LAKESIDE_CLEAR_COLOR, fog per ?lakefog (layered:
board slab with fogRange/w, slab offset by the lakeside root y; linear60 pushed out; off untouched).
RegionJourneyAdapter: prime() when the journey scenes are shown (under the set-off black) captures the
island values and enables the fog at ~zero density (fog shader variant switch under black, none at board
entry); progress(d) writes the blend; restore() on dispose/主页 puts back exactly what was captured.
RegionJourneyCore: optional JourneySceneLease.progress(distance), called each observed frame and at the stop
(errors swallowed, never break the walk). Board: scales from lakesideJourneyBaseIllum() so the board lands
on the same numbers (no double scale). Route gets timing:L.timing (运镜bot's lakesideJourney contract).
Test: tools/lakeside/test_lakeside_journey_atmosphere.cjs (suite: lakeside-journey-atmosphere).

